sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Owner as Owner<br/>Management App
  actor Admin as Super Admin
  participant BFF as BFF<br/>SaaS API
  participant SaaS as SaaS<br/>subscription services
  participant SDB as PostgreSQL<br/>SaaS DB
  participant Redis as Redis<br/>subscription cache
  participant Sepay as SePay / Bank

  Owner->>BFF: Checkout subscription invoice
  BFF->>SaaS: CHECKOUT_INVOICE
  SaaS->>SDB: Create PENDING invoice<br/>with QRSUB reference
  SaaS-->>Owner: Invoice + QR payload

  alt Paid by SePay
    Sepay->>BFF: POST platform webhook
    BFF->>SaaS: HANDLE_WEBHOOK
    SaaS->>SDB: Lock invoice by QRSUB reference
    SaaS->>SDB: Mark paid and assign plan
  else Manually confirmed by platform admin
    Admin->>BFF: Manual confirm invoice with note
    BFF->>SaaS: MANUAL_CONFIRM_INVOICE
    SaaS->>SDB: Mark paid and assign plan
  end

  SaaS->>SDB: Supersede old subscription<br/>create ACTIVE subscription
  SaaS->>Redis: Cache plan limits and features

  opt Subscription expires beyond grace
    SaaS->>SDB: Suspend tenant
    SaaS->>Redis: Cache suspended status
  end

  Note over SaaS,Redis: Subscription changes update a short-lived entitlement cache<br/>Tenant lifecycle remains a SaaS-owned state
